OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Lights illuminate the
OL,4,AEast of England
OL,5,
OL,6,FNight owls and stargazers have been
OL,7,Ftreated to a spectacular display of
OL,8,Fcolour, as the Northern Lights lit up
OL,9,Fthe skies across the East of England.
OL,11,FPeople across the region captured the
OL,12,Fgreen and pink glow on their cameras on
OL,13,FSaturday night.
OL,15,FAlso known as the Aurora Borealis, the
OL,16,Fnaturally occurring spectacle is the
OL,17,Fresult of solar eruptions sending
OL,18,Fparticles towards Earth and interacting
OL,19,Fwith particles in the atmosphere.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
